{"material_id":"mat_81b65cdeb98e","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"cmuk25h00156vro9h173e1zjz","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"小米 MiMo：官网发布与博客","author_followers":null,"title":"小米 MiMo-V2.6 诊断并修复工具调用重复问题，用 MOPD 将修复成本降至 MixRL 方案的 4%","excerpt":"小米官方复盘 MiMo-V2.6 发布后的工具调用重复问题，响应级重复率超 0.05%，并区分了正常并行调用、调用泛滥与调用重复。回放 RL 各 checkpoint 显示泛滥率随训练从 11.1% 升至 24.6%，32 次调用阈值惩罚过于宽松；直接调低阈值需重启 20 步 MixRL，估计成本 231 万美元，且内部测试重复率仅从 13.45% 降至 3.83%。","source_url":"https://mimo.xiaomi.com/blog/mimo-v2-6-tool-call-repetition","canonical_url":"https://mimo.xiaomi.com/blog/mimo-v2-6-tool-call-repetition","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-09-26T16:00:00.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-09-28T06:27:25.780Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance","below_overall_threshold"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"小米 MiMo：官网发布与博客","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["actionable_update","ai_news"],"relevance_score":35,"freshness_score":80,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":55,"fingerprint":"81b65cdeb98e878da5b7a0695b02d922f67190252e3784373258de1111aa980a","content_fingerprint":"157003f762b86709b6f52097f5586b79e425eb80e3828fdea44dcbade5d8f88b"}
